---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Mint Oreo Blizzard",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/mint-oreo-blizzard.webp",
      "description": "Oreo cookie pieces and cool mint flavoring blended into DQ vanilla soft serve. The mint-chocolate-cookie Blizzard — same Oreo crunch as the classic, plus a refreshing mint layer.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "3.49",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/mint-oreo-blizzard"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "~440 cal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is the Mint Oreo Blizzard?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mini $3.49, Small $4.49, Medium $5.49, Large $5.99 — same price as the standard Oreo Blizzard."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is Mint Oreo different from the standard Oreo Blizzard?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mint Oreo adds cool mint flavoring to the standard Oreo Blizzard, creating a mint-chocolate-cookie experience. The Oreo pieces and soft serve base are the same."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the Mint Oreo Blizzard available year-round?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Availability varies by location. Some DQ locations carry it year-round; others only seasonally. Check the DQ app or your local DQ to confirm."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Mint Oreo Blizzard — Price, Calories 2026" description="DQ Mint Oreo Blizzard: Oreo pieces and cool mint flavoring blended into DQ soft serve. Mini from $3.49. Seasonal availability. Full 2026 price and calorie...">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats</a></li><li aria-current="page">Mint Oreo Blizzard</li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/mint-oreo-blizzard.webp" alt="Mint Oreo Blizzard® — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Oreo + Cool Mint</span><span class="badge">~440 Cal Small</span><span class="badge blue">Seasonal Availability</span></div>
      <h1>Mint Oreo Blizzard®</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $3.49</div>
      <p>Crushed chocolate Oreo sandwich cookies and icy crème de menthe syrup whipped into signature vanilla soft serve. Delivering crisp dark wafer crunch softened by a brisk, invigorating wave of herbal peppermint coolness, starting from $3.49.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$3.49 (Mini)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>~440 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Mix-ins</td><td>Oreo cookie pieces + mint flavoring</td></tr><tr><td>vs. Standard Oreo</td><td>~20 cal more, adds mint layer</td></tr><tr><td>Allergens</td><td>Milk, Wheat, Soy</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Mini</strong></td><td>$3.49</td><td class="price-cell">~300 cal</td><td>~10g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Small</strong></td><td>$4.49</td><td class="price-cell">~440 cal</td><td>~15g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Medium</strong></td><td>$5.49</td><td class="price-cell">~610 cal</td><td>~21g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Large</strong></td><td>$5.99</td><td class="price-cell">~950 cal</td><td>~32g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Local DQ prices may vary.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Flavor Architecture: Mint Infusion vs. Classic Oreo</h2>
  <p>While the undisputed flagship <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo® Cookie Blizzard</a> centers entirely on comforting vanilla-cream and cocoa wafer contrast, the Mint Oreo introduces an exhilarating botanical chill. The mint syrup cuts through the rich dairy fats of the soft serve, preventing palate fatigue and transforming every spoonful into an icy, grasshopper-pie style indulgence. At an identical entry price point of $3.49 for a Mini, it remains one of Dairy Queen's most successful flavor extensions. Compare both alongside the full menu at <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mint Oreo Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~440</td><td>Oreo crunch + cool mint layer</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Oreo Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>420</td><td>Pure cookie-cream, no mint</td></tr><tr><td>Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~480</td><td>Cocoa + peppermint — winter seasonal</td></tr><tr><td>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>510</td><td>Intense chocolate, no mint</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Tasting Notes &amp; Ordering Recommendations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Palate Cleanser Extraordinaire:</strong> The crisp menthol finish makes this the supreme post-meal treat after heavy, spicy entrees like the <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">FlameThrower Stackburger</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Intensity:</strong> For an extra hit of spearmint coolness, request an extra pump of mint flavoring (~$0.30–$0.50) to enhance the vivid green hue and aromatic chill.</li>
    <li><strong>The Royal Alternative:</strong> If you love mint chocolate but crave molten fudge centers, check seasonal boards for the peppermint holiday rotations or consider blending hot fudge into your Mint Oreo.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Related Blizzard Treats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Cookie Blizzard — $3.49 Mini (standard version)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo Blizzard — $3.99 Mini (fudge center upgrade)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/peppermint-hot-cocoa-blizzard">Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard — winter seasonal mint option</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">All DQ Blizzard Treats</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the Mint Oreo Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Mini $3.49, Small $4.49, Medium $5.49, Large $5.99 — same price as the standard Oreo Blizzard.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How is Mint Oreo different from the standard Oreo Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Mint Oreo adds cool mint flavoring to the standard Oreo Blizzard, creating a mint-chocolate-cookie experience. The Oreo pieces and soft serve base are the same.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the Mint Oreo Blizzard available year-round?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Availability varies by location. Some DQ locations carry it year-round; others only seasonally. Check the DQ app or your local DQ to confirm.</div></div>
    </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For every DQ price, flavor, and category, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
